{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sawi, The VoidBuster</i>\u00a0is a fast-paced 2D platformer with tight controls, charm, and emotional depth.<br>You play as\u00a0<strong>Sawi</strong>, the greatest (alien) VoidBuster in the galaxy!<br>With\u00a0<strong>ClavY</strong>, your robot companion, you\u2019ll travel across strange worlds, busting void and helping clients in need.<br>But it\u2019s not just about jumping and running; beneath the action lies a heartwarming story, as Sawi navigates a personal work crisis and searches for meaning beyond the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002870/extras/e7792e3eddbf0560ed372281c7176f92.avif?t=1761138025\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002870/extras_big/e7792e3eddbf0560ed372281c7176f92.webp?t=1761138025 width=1560 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002870/extras/d8d96ed0d0add3b0e8a28878ceb4d56c.poster.avif?t=1761138025\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002870/extras/d8d96ed0d0add3b0e8a28878ceb4d56c.webm?t=1761138025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002870/extras/d8d96ed0d0add3b0e8a28878ceb4d56c.mp4?t=1761138025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002870/extras/491cffcf259932b6a31e826afae198d9.poster.avif?t=1761138025\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store